  "body": "Discover elevated coastal living at 2B Rangitoto Terrace, Milford, a brand-new residence that combines space, luxury, and thoughtful design in one of the North Shore’s most sought-after locations. Positioned to capture stunning sea views, this home offers both comfort and sophistication just moments from Milford Beach and village.\r\n\r\nKey Features:\r\n• Brand new architecturally designed home\r\n• Floor area: 198m² | Land area: 171m²\r\n• 4 bedrooms and 3.5 bathrooms\r\n• Private lift for easy multi-level access\r\n• Spacious open-plan living with premium finishes\r\n• Modern kitchen ideal for entertaining\r\n• Internal access garage\r\n• Elevated position with sea views\r\n• Zoned for Westlake Boys’ & Westlake Girls’ High Schools and Milford Primary School\r\n• Close to Milford Beach, shops, and dining\r\n\r\nDesigned for modern lifestyles, this home offers exceptional flexibility with its multi-level layout and lift access—perfect for families, downsizers, or those seeking future-proof living. Enjoy the convenience of being within walking distance to Milford Beach and village, while also benefiting from easy motorway access and nearby amenities.\r\n\r\nOpportunities like this in Milford are rarely available—secure your place in this premium coastal neighbourhood. Contact Annie Xu today to arrange a viewing",
